# shell: desktop
# lang: fr
# The words come from the catalogue, not the code: run in French, and the
# menu and the window that open are French, accents and all.
wait 15
key w ctrl
wait 5
click 980 20
wait 6
expect-menu À propos de ce système|Rechercher…|Réglages|Applications|-|/sys|/dev|/data|-|Dossiers récents|-|<Deskbar folder is empty>|-|Arrêter…|
menu-pick Réglages
wait 5
menu-pick Polices
wait 12
expect-title Polices
note the window's own labels are French too
quit
